p1 meta lang.pattern.p1 stated "the agent works in the directory it is started in and may read and write it => fact workdir.access \"readwrite\"" @gen:d95ce33ac8994c8b
p2 meta lang.pattern.p2 stated "the agent works in the directory it is started in and may read it => fact workdir.access \"read\"" @gen:d95ce33ac8994c8b
p3 meta lang.pattern.p3 stated "it may read <p.list:,|and|or> => fact fs.read.<p:index> \"<p>\"" @gen:d95ce33ac8994c8b
p4 meta lang.pattern.p4 stated "it may never read <p.list:,|and|or> => fact fs.deny.<p:index> \"<p>\"" @gen:d95ce33ac8994c8b
p5 meta lang.pattern.p5 stated "it may run <c.list:,|and|or> => fact cmd.<c>.policy \"allow\"" @gen:d95ce33ac8994c8b
p6 meta lang.pattern.p6 stated "it may never run <c.list:,|and|or> => fact cmd.<c>.policy \"deny\"" @gen:d95ce33ac8994c8b
p7 meta lang.pattern.p7 stated "it must ask me before running <cmd> <sub> => fact cmd.<cmd>.approve \"<sub>\"" @gen:d95ce33ac8994c8b
p8 meta lang.pattern.p8 stated "on the network it may reach <d.list:,|and> and nothing else => fact net.allow.<d:index> \"<d>\"" @gen:d95ce33ac8994c8b
